### 1. Login as the seeded demo user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@fulfillmesh.local",
  "password": "demo12345"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. View inventory
GET http://localhost:8082/api/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Create an order
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idea-demo-001

{
  "items": [
    {"sku": "SKU-A", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-B", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-C", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-D", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-E", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-F", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-G", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "SKU-H", "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### 4. Replace ORDER_ID after the create request
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Fulfillment result
GET http://localhost:8083/api/fulfillments/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Shipment result
GET http://localhost:8084/api/shipments/orders/ORDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
